_:genid7 <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#first> <https://pokemonkg.org/ontology#Generation> .
_:genid7 <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#List> .
_:genid8 <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#first> <https://pokemonkg.org/ontology#Flavor> .
_:genid8 <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#List> .
<https://pokemonkg.org/ontology#Ability> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "Abilities were introduced in Generation III as an all new game mechanic. Each and every Pokémon has an ability, and can only have one at a time. Some abilities are exclusive to certain Pokémon and Evolution lines, while others are known by many Pokémon."@en .
<https://pokemonkg.org/ontology#Ability> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "Fähigkeiten wurden in Generation III als völlig neue Spielmechanik eingeführt. Jeder einzelne Pokémon hat eine Fähigkeit und kann nur eine auf einmal haben. Einige Fähigkeiten sind exklusiv für bestimmte Pokémon- und Evolutionslinien, während andere von vielen Pokémon bekannt sind."@de .
<https://pokemonkg.org/ontology#Ability> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#isDefinedBy> <https://pokemonkg.org/ontology> .
<https://pokemonkg.org/ontology#Ability> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "Ability"@en .
<https://pokemonkg.org/ontology#Ability> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "Fähigkeit"@de .
# 
# https://pokemonkg.org/ontology#BattleItem
<https://pokemonkg.org/ontology#BattleItem> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#Class> .
<https://pokemonkg.org/ontology#BattleItem> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#subClassOf> <https://pokemonkg.org/ontology#Item> .
<https://pokemonkg.org/ontology#BattleItem> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#isDefinedBy> <https://pokemonkg.org/ontology> .
# 
# https://pokemonkg.org/ontology#Berry
<https://pokemonkg.org/ontology#Berry> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#Class> .
<https://pokemonkg.org/ontology#Berry> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#subClassOf> <https://pokemonkg.org/ontology#Food> .
<https://pokemonkg.org/ontology#Berry> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "Beeren sind kleine, saftige, fleischige Früchte. Wie in der realen Welt gibt es auch in der Pokémon-Welt eine große Vielfalt mit einer großen Auswahl an Geschmacksrichtungen, Namen und Effekten. Erstmals in den Spielen der Generation II gefunden, sind viele Beeren inzwischen zu kritischen Gegenständen im Kampf geworden, wo ihre verschiedenen Effekte die Wiederherstellung von HP und Statuszustand, Statikverbesserung und sogar Schadensverneinung beinhalten."@de .
<https://pokemonkg.org/ontology#Berry> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "Berries are small, juicy, fleshy fruit. As in the real world, a large variety exists in the Pokémon world, with a large range of flavors, names, and effects. First found in the Generation II games, many Berries have since become critical held items in battle, where their various effects include HP and status condition restoration, stat enhancement, and even damage negation."@en .
<https://pokemonkg.org/ontology#Berry> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#isDefinedBy> <https://pokemonkg.org/ontology> .
<https://pokemonkg.org/ontology#Berry> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "Beere"@de .
<https://pokemonkg.org/ontology#Berry> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "Berry"@en .
# 
# https://pokemonkg.org/ontology#EggGroup
<https://pokemonkg.org/ontology#EggGroup> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#Class> .
<https://pokemonkg.org/ontology#EggGroup> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "Egg group is a category that determines which Pokémon are able to interbreed. The concept was introduced in Generation II, along with breeding. Similar to types, a Pokémon may belong to either one or two egg groups."@en .
<https://pokemonkg.org/ontology#EggGroup> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#isDefinedBy> <https://pokemonkg.org/ontology> .
<https://pokemonkg.org/ontology#EggGroup> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "Egg Group"@en .
<https://pokemonkg.org/ontology#EggGroup> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "Ei-Gruppe"@de .
# 
# https://pokemonkg.org/ontology#Flavor
<https://pokemonkg.org/ontology#Flavor> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#Class> .
<https://pokemonkg.org/ontology#Flavor> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "Flavor is a special set of attributes that certain foods in the Pokémon world have. Most of the foods can have more than one flavor attributed to them."@en .
<https://pokemonkg.org/ontology#Flavor> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "Geschmacksrichtung ist ein spezielles Attribut für Nahrung in der Pokémon-Welt. Den meisten Nahrungen können mehr als eine Geschmacksrichtung haben."@de .
