# https://pokemonkg.org/ontology#GymLeader
<https://pokemonkg.org/ontology#GymLeader> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#Class> .
<https://pokemonkg.org/ontology#GymLeader> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#subClassOf> <https://pokemonkg.org/ontology#Trainer> .
<https://pokemonkg.org/ontology#GymLeader> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "A gym leader is the highest-ranking member and owner of an official Pokémon Gym. Gym leaders use their gyms and their Pokémon to test the skills of trainers that challenge them, and if said trainers win a battle, the gym leader will gift them with a badge that's unique to that specific gym."@en .
<https://pokemonkg.org/ontology#GymLeader> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#isDefinedBy> <https://pokemonkg.org/ontology> .
