<https://pokemonkg.org/ontology#PokéType_Electric> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "Es gibt relativ wenige Electric Pokémon; tatsächlich wurden in der dritten Generation nur vier hinzugefügt. Die meisten basieren auf Nagetieren oder unbelebten Objekten."@de .
<https://pokemonkg.org/ontology#PokéType_Electric> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "There are relatively few Electric Pokémon; in fact only four were added in the third generation. Most are based on rodents or inanimate objects."@en .
